<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="space-y-12 text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm mb-4 tracking-widest">1. Data Collection</h2>
            <p>At Closet Flow, we collect only the necessary information to provide our rental services. This includes your username, email, and rental history.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm mb-4 tracking-widest">2. Usage of Information</h2>
            <p>Your data is used to manage rentals, communicate about status updates, and improve your user experience. We never sell your personal data to third parties.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm mb-4 tracking-widest">3. Security</h2>
            <p>We implement modern security measures to protect your account and personal information. Passwords are salted and hashed using industry-standard algorithms.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-sm mb-4 tracking-widest">4. Cookies</h2>
            <p>We use essential cookies to maintain your login session. No tracking or marketing cookies are used without your consent.</p>
        </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
        <p class="text-white/40 text-xs text-center">Last Updated: April 2026</p>
    </div>
</div>
